Benefits of This Refactor

1. Removes Code Duplication → The promo logic is now handled in a single reusable method.


2. Better Readability → The new method is self-contained and modular.


3. Easier to Maintain → If promo logic changes, you only update it in one place.


4. More Scalable → If more promo fields are added, you just extend the helper methods.



